{"id":"c5e7f4273f7b74de","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top7 Resolvable Space","display":"df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space — ZFC Top7 Resolvable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space — ZFC Top7 Resolvable Space","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space — ZFC Top7 Resolvable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}resolvable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}resolvable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A space is resolvable exactly when it has two disjoint dense subsets; the dense-set predicate also enforces that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> is a topological space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S$ (dense-set predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}resolvable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7ResolvableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,B))","display":true},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false}],"bytes":1004,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3640","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space.md|58-df-zfc-top7-resolvable-space]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["855dfa27460aa1ec"]}